abstract: >-
  Simulation code and figures of the doctoral thesis "Gouvernance du numérique
  à l'ère de l'IA : modélisation systémique de l'inclusion, de la soutenabilité
  et de la confiance" (University of Toamasina, 2026): dynamic governance model
  G(t) linking inclusion (I), sustainability (S) and trust (T), revised digital
  trust index (DTI, UAMINIFU framework), AI energy projections for Africa and
  the case of the Comoros. Figures are provided for the French manuscript and
  its English version.
keywords:
  - digital governance
  - Internet governance
  - artificial intelligence
  - systems modelling
  - digital trust
  - sustainability
  - inclusion
  - Comoros
  - small island developing states
